---
import { site } from '../../config/site';
---

<section class="home-final snap-page">
  <div class="home-final__copy">
    <h2><span class="title-line">OpenDesk CLI</span></h2>
    <p>CLI 与桌面 App 共享同一套智能体能力。</p>
    <p>你可以在命令行里发起任务、观察执行过程、接入同样的模型、插件、MCP 与 Skills，用更简约、更极客的入口把工作交给 OpenDesk。</p>
    <div class="home-actions">
      <a class="home-button" href="/docs/manual/cli/">浏览 CLI 手册</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="home-final__visual">
    <img src="/assets/images/gallery/file_managing.gif" alt="OpenDesk CLI 文件管理演示" />
  </div>
  <footer class="home-final__footer">
    <div class="site-footer__top">
      <img
        class="site-footer__logo site-footer__logo--light"
        src="/assets/images/common/footer-logo.svg"
        alt="OpenAtom OpenHarmony"
      />
      <img
        class="site-footer__logo site-footer__logo--dark"
        src="/assets/images/common/footer-logo-dark.svg"
        alt="OpenAtom OpenHarmony"
      />
      <div class="site-footer__social">
        <a class="site-footer__social-btn" href={site.socialLinks.email} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="邮件">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i>
        </a>
        <button class="site-footer__social-btn" type="button" title="资讯">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-qrcode"></i>
        </button>
        <a class="site-footer__social-btn" href={site.socialLinks.repo} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="GitCode">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-git-alt"></i>
        </a>
        <a class="site-footer__social-btn" href={site.socialLinks.bilibili} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Bilibili">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-bilibili"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="site-footer__foundation">
      <p class="site-footer__foundation-desc">{site.foundationDesc}</p>
      <div class="site-footer__protocol-links">
        {site.protocolLinks.map((link) => (
          <a href={link.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{link.label}</a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="site-footer__bottom">
      <span>开放原子开源基金会版权所有</span>
      <span>{site.foundationCopyright}</span>
    </div>
  </footer>
</section>
